  "primaryModel": "Official Moebius ft_places2",
  "sourceRevision": "b88d462bacb9af6e7128a3b4cc4a07418bedfd61",
  "qualityConclusions": [
    "Resolution is a confound: LaMa also improves greatly at512 compared with its previous native runs.",
    "Original child silhouette missed a strip of trousers. Expanded selection fixes that retained-source artifact.",
    "Default Moebius sampling can replace unwanted people with new people, poles or dark objects.",
    "Corrected masks plus strength1.0 pure-noise initialization remove the invented object on both tested rear-person seeds and improve the barrier. Limited sample, not a robustness claim.",
    "Generation at512 plus ordinary bilinear upsampling does not restore native RAW texture; RAW bakes expose patch boundaries."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Assistant-reviewed masks, not human-verified ground truth",
    "Private local photos; no original or XMP writes",
    "No CoreML conversion, UI integration or deployment qualification",
    "Original-mask RAW child trials retain the diagnosed mask confound; corrected-mask RAW trials are separate",
    "No shipping pass or proof of impossibility for Moebius",
    "Klein and Qwen not executed in this bounded Moebius experiment"
  ],
